@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Create Root Category (Electronics)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "parentCategoryId": null
}

### 2. Create Sub-Category (Smartphones)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smartphones",
  "parentCategoryId": 1
}

### 3. Get Root Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/roots

### 4. Get Sub-Categories of Electronics
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/1/subcategories

### 5. Get Category by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/2

### 6. Create Product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "iPhone 15",
  "desc": "Apple flagship smartphone with A16 Bionic chip",
  "categoryId": 2
}

### 7. Add Variant to Product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/1/variants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "IP15-128-BLK",
  "price": 799.99,
  "attributes": {
    "color": "Black",
    "storage": "128GB"
  }
}

### 8. Get Product by ID (Includes Variants)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### 9. Get Products by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?categoryId=2

### 10. Update Stock (Requires Warehouse #1 in DB)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/stocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "warehouseId": 1,
  "variantId": 1,
  "quantity": 25
}

### 11. Get Stock Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/stocks?warehouseId=1&variantId=1

### 12. Get All Stock for Warehouse
GET {{baseUrl}}/stocks/warehouse/1